without the suffix.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/AUR_submission_guidelines#Rules_of_submission>","+  pub pkgname: Option<String>,","+  /// The package release number, to be incremented when the package changes but the app","+  /// version does not, for instance to fix a packaging mistake. Reset it to `1` on new versions.","+  /// Defaults to `1`.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#pkgrel>","+  pub pkgrel: Option<String>,","+  /// Forces the package to be seen as newer than any previous version with a lower epoch,","+  /// used when the versioning scheme changes. Must not be decreased.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#epoch>","+  pub epoch: Option<u32>,","+  /// The package maintainer, written to the `# Maintainer:` comment the AUR expects at the top","+  /// of the PKGBUILD, for instance `Jane Doe <jane at example dot com>`.","+  /// Defaults to the app authors.","+  pub maintainer: Option<String>,","+  /// List of softwares that must be installed for the app to build and run.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#depends>","+  pub depends: Option<Vec<String>>,","+  /// Optional packages that enable additional features of the app, but are not required to run it.","+  /// Each entry is the package name, optionally followed by `: ` and the reason,","+  /// for instance `libappindicator-gtk3: tray icon support`.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#optdepends>","+  pub optdepends: Option<Vec<String>>,","+  /// Additional packages that are provided by this app.","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#provides>","+  pub provides: Option<Vec<String>>,","+  /// Packages that conflict or cause problems with the app.","+  /// All these packages and packages providing this item will need to be removed","+  ///","+  /// See : <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/PKGBUILD#conflicts>","+  pub conflicts: 